NOND
----

NOND is a smart inventory management application designed for small
vendors and retail businesses such as electronics stores, stationery
shops, kirana stores, and other local businesses.

It helps vendors manage products, stock, suppliers, customers, and
transactions while building a connected representation of their
business data .


